<title>JAPAN: Japan's Finance Ministry to offer T-bills on Wed.</title>
<headline>Japan's Finance Ministry to offer T-bills on Wed.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) is planning to offer Treasury bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction on Wednesday, a MOF source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The offering is likely to be a rollover of 1.4 trillion yen worth of three-month T-bills maturing next Monday, bond traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
